        "id": 234476,
        "name": "der andere Jan",
        "username": "der_andere_Jan",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/der_andere_jan/{size}/1881_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-12-22T22:41:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You're in luck, I made a Villain that might fit your bill for a homespun story of my own.<br>\nNarratively, it's not quite the Quackerjack concept you have in mind, but you should be able to make do with the stats easily.</p>\n<p>To avoid confusion: My stories often allow for&nbsp;villains to become (temporary) allies if circumstances demand, so there is a section below to run the Villain as a Lieutenant on the sidelines of the plot.</p>\n<p>Have fun, and let me know how it went!</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:10:35.017Z",
