        "raw": "<p>You're in luck, I made a Villain that might fit your bill for a homespun story of my own.<br />\r\nNarratively, it's not quite the Quackerjack concept you have in mind, but you should be able to make do with the stats easily.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To avoid confusion: My stories often allow for&nbsp;villains to become (temporary) allies if circumstances demand, so there is a section below to run the Villain as a Lieutenant on the sidelines of the plot.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Have fun, and let me know how it went!</p>",
